ARCHIVED (2026) - no longer maintained.

This was a 2017 monitoring program for Ubiquiti airMAX devices
(discovery, SSH status polling, ping checks, config backups).
It targets Django 1.10 and is kept for reference only.

Known issues, not fixed: shell command injection in lib/discover.py
and lib/backup.py, plaintext device credentials, SSH host key
checking disabled. Do not deploy it.

Configuration (if you run it anyway): set DJANGO_SECRET_KEY,
optionally DJANGO_DEBUG=1 and DJANGO_ALLOWED_HOSTS.

Firmware images were removed; get them from Ubiquiti.

Original dependencies: parallel-ssh, python-nmap, django
